{"seq":1,"slug":"pitch-system","title":"十二平均律与音高体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/music-theory-foundations/pitch-rhythm/pitch-system","wordCount":1616,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"十二平均律与音高体系\">十二平均律与音高体系</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>音高体系建立在三个层层递进的概念之上：物理频率、心理感知与律制约定。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>频率决定音高，但感知是对数的</strong>：人耳将频率翻倍感知为&quot;升高了八度&quot;，而非&quot;升高了一倍&quot;，这一对数关系是音高组织的心理基础。</li>\n<li><strong>泛音列决定协和性</strong>：自然泛音 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2f_0, 3f_0, 4f_0, \\ldots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span> 之间的整数比越简洁，对应音程听起来越协和（八度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、纯五度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3:2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>十二平均律用等比数列抹平差异</strong>：每个半音的频率比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.05946</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{1/12} \\approx 1.05946</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.05946</span></span></span></span></span>，以牺牲单个音程的纯度，换取任意调性之间的自由转调。</li>\n<li><strong>时值遵循二分递归</strong>：全音符逐级二分产生二分、四分、八分音符；附点延长一半，三连音引入二等分之外的划分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四个概念分别回答了&quot;音为什么有高低&quot;&quot;哪些音一起好听&quot;&quot;十二个音如何定音&quot;&quot;音有多长&quot;四个基础问题，是后续音程、调式与节奏讨论的共同前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"声音的物理基础与音高感知\">声音的物理基础与音高感知</h2><p>声音是由物体振动产生的纵波，在空气中以约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>340</mn><mtext> m/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">340 \\text{ m/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">340</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m/s</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的速度传播。人耳能感知的频率范围大约在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext> Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 \\text{ Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20000</mn><mtext> Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20000 \\text{ Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间，而音乐使用的音高范围通常集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>27.5</mn><mtext> Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">27.5 \\text{ Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span>（钢琴最低音 A0）到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4186</mn><mtext> Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4186 \\text{ Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4186</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span>（钢琴最高音 C8）的区间内。</p>\n<p>音高感知与频率之间并非简单的线性关系。人耳对频率的感知遵循对数规律——频率翻倍时，人耳感受到的是&quot;升高了一个八度&quot;而非&quot;升高了一倍&quot;。这一特性构成了音乐音高系统设计的物理基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;物体振动&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;空气纵波&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;耳膜共振&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;频率→音高感知&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;对数关系&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;八度等价性&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"物体振动\"] --&gt; B[\"空气纵波\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"耳膜共振\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"频率→音高感知\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"对数关系\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"八度等价性\"]</pre><p>一个关键的声学概念是<strong>泛音列</strong>。当一根弦以基频 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 振动时，它同时产生频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2f_0, 3f_0, 4f_0, \\ldots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span> 的泛音。泛音的相对强度决定了音色（timbre），而泛音列中各频率之间的比例关系则是音程协和性的物理来源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>泛音序号</th>\n<th>频率比</th>\n<th>对应音程</th>\n<th>协和程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>同度</td>\n<td>完全协和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>八度</td>\n<td>完全协和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3:2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>纯五度</td>\n<td>完全协和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4:3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>纯四度</td>\n<td>完全协和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5:4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大三度</td>\n<td>不完全协和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6:5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>小三度</td>\n<td>不完全协和</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"十二平均律的数学原理\">十二平均律的数学原理</h2><p>十二平均律（Equal Temperament）是现代西方音乐的标准律制。其核心思想是将一个八度的频率空间等分为十二个相等的半音，每个半音的频率比为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mroot><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></mroot><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.05946</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = \\sqrt[12]{2} = 2^{1/12} \\approx 1.05946</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.0839em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"root\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8455em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0233em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9561em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9161em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0839em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.05946</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>设基准音 A4 的频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>440</mn><mtext> Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">440 \\text{ Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">440</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span>，则任意音高距 A4 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个半音时，其频率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>440</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = 440 \\times 2^{n/12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">440</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>十二平均律的历史源头可追溯到明代朱载堉（1536-1611），他在《律学新说》中首次以数学方法精确计算了等比律的频率比值。在欧洲，J.S. Bach 的《平均律钢琴曲集》（1722）则展示了平均律在转调方面的优势。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 十二平均律音名排列&#10;        C[&quot;C&quot;] --&gt; Cs[&quot;C♯/D♭&quot;]&#10;        Cs --&gt; D[&quot;D&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; Ds[&quot;D♯/E♭&quot;]&#10;        Ds --&gt; E[&quot;E&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; F[&quot;F&quot;]&#10;        F --&gt; Fs[&quot;F♯/G♭&quot;]&#10;        Fs --&gt; G[&quot;G&quot;]&#10;        G --&gt; Gs[&quot;G♯/A♭&quot;]&#10;        Gs --&gt; A[&quot;A&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; As[&quot;A♯/B♭&quot;]&#10;        As --&gt; B[&quot;B&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C2[&quot;C (高八度)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 十二平均律音名排列\n        C[\"C\"] --&gt; Cs[\"C♯/D♭\"]\n        Cs --&gt; D[\"D\"]\n        D --&gt; Ds[\"D♯/E♭\"]\n        Ds --&gt; E[\"E\"]\n        E --&gt; F[\"F\"]\n        F --&gt; Fs[\"F♯/G♭\"]\n        Fs --&gt; G[\"G\"]\n        G --&gt; Gs[\"G♯/A♭\"]\n        Gs --&gt; A[\"A\"]\n        A --&gt; As[\"A♯/B♭\"]\n        As --&gt; B[\"B\"]\n        B --&gt; C2[\"C (高八度)\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"音名系统与等音异名\">音名系统与等音异名</h2><p>在十二平均律框架中，每个音高可以用不同的名称表示，这就是<strong>等音异名</strong>（Enharmonic Equivalence）现象。例如 C♯ 与 D♭ 在频率上完全相同，但在不同的调性语境中具有不同的功能意义。</p>\n<p>国际通用的音名系统采用 C、D、E、F、G、A、B 七个字母作为基本音名，配合升号（♯）、降号（♭）和还原号（♮）来表示所有十二个音级。八度标记采用科学记谱法：中央 C 记为 C4，A4 = 440 Hz 是国际标准音。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>音名</th>\n<th>频率 (Hz)</th>\n<th>与 C4 的半音距离</th>\n<th>MIDI 编号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>C4</td>\n<td>261.63</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>60</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D4</td>\n<td>293.66</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>62</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E4</td>\n<td>329.63</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F4</td>\n<td>349.23</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>65</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G4</td>\n<td>392.00</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>67</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A4</td>\n<td>440.00</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>69</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B4</td>\n<td>493.88</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>71</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C5</td>\n<td>523.25</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>72</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"节奏的时值体系\">节奏的时值体系</h2><p>音符时值构成一个二分递归的层级系统。以全音符为基准单位（在 4/4 拍中占满一个小节），每级细分产生下一级时值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>全音符</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>二分音符</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>四分音符</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>八分音符</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>十六分音符</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{全音符} \\to \\text{二分音符} \\to \\text{四分音符} \\to \\text{八分音符} \\to \\text{十六分音符}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全音符</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">二分音符</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">四分音符</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">八分音符</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">十六分音符</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>附点（dot）将音符时值延长其自身的一半：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>附点四分音符时值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> 拍</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{附点四分音符时值} = 1 + \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{3}{2} \\text{ 拍}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">附点四分音符时值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">拍</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三连音（triplet）则将一个时值等分为三份，引入了二进制之外的节奏划分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>三连音八分音符</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>四分音符时值</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{三连音八分音符} = \\frac{1}{3} \\times \\text{四分音符时值}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">三连音八分音符</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">四分音符时值</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    W[&quot;全音符 (4拍)&quot;] --&gt; H1[&quot;二分音符 (2拍)&quot;]&#10;    W --&gt; H2[&quot;二分音符 (2拍)&quot;]&#10;    H1 --&gt; Q1[&quot;四分音符 (1拍)&quot;]&#10;    H1 --&gt; Q2[&quot;四分音符 (1拍)&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt; E1[&quot;八分音符 (1/2拍)&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt; E2[&quot;八分音符 (1/2拍)&quot;]&#10;    E1 --&gt; S1[&quot;十六分音符 (1/4拍)&quot;]&#10;    E1 --&gt; S2[&quot;十六分音符 (1/4拍)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    W[\"全音符 (4拍)\"] --&gt; H1[\"二分音符 (2拍)\"]\n    W --&gt; H2[\"二分音符 (2拍)\"]\n    H1 --&gt; Q1[\"四分音符 (1拍)\"]\n    H1 --&gt; Q2[\"四分音符 (1拍)\"]\n    Q1 --&gt; E1[\"八分音符 (1/2拍)\"]\n    Q1 --&gt; E2[\"八分音符 (1/2拍)\"]\n    E1 --&gt; S1[\"十六分音符 (1/4拍)\"]\n    E1 --&gt; S2[\"十六分音符 (1/4拍)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"历史律制比较与现代应用\">历史律制比较与现代应用</h2><p>十二平均律并非唯一的律制选择。历史上重要的律制还包括五度相生律（Pythagorean Tuning）、纯律（Just Intonation）以及各种历史调律法。它们各有利弊：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>律制</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>五度相生律</td>\n<td>纯五度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3:2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 连续叠加</td>\n<td>五度极纯净</td>\n<td>三度不协和，无法自由转调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯律</td>\n<td>基于自然泛音列的整数比</td>\n<td>和弦极协和</td>\n<td>转调时音高漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>十二平均律</td>\n<td>八度十二等分</td>\n<td>完全自由转调</td>\n<td>所有音程略有偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中庸全音律</td>\n<td>折中调整各音程</td>\n<td>常用调较纯净</td>\n<td>远关系调不可用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在现代音乐制作中，十二平均律是 MIDI 与数字音频的默认标准。但微分音音乐（Microtonal Music）正在探索超越十二等分的可能性——24 等分（四分音）、31 等分、53 等分等系统各有拥护者。2024 年以来，Aphex Twin、Sevish 等电子音乐人在微分音领域的实验持续获得关注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>音高感知遵循对数规律，八度等价性（频率比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）是音高系统的第一性原理。</li>\n<li>泛音列的整数比解释了音程协和性的物理来源，比值越简越协和。</li>\n<li>十二平均律以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{1/12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等分八度，是 MIDI 与数字音频的默认律制，代价是所有音程都略有偏差。</li>\n<li>历史上五度相生律、纯律、中庸全音律各有取舍，微分音音乐则在探索十二等分之外的可能性。</li>\n<li>时值体系以二分递归为主干，附点与三连音提供非二分的变体。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"十二平均律与音高体系","id":"十二平均律与音高体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"声音的物理基础与音高感知","id":"声音的物理基础与音高感知"},{"level":2,"text":"十二平均律的数学原理","id":"十二平均律的数学原理"},{"level":2,"text":"音名系统与等音异名","id":"音名系统与等音异名"},{"level":2,"text":"节奏的时值体系","id":"节奏的时值体系"},{"level":2,"text":"历史律制比较与现代应用","id":"历史律制比较与现代应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"音程的分类与度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/music-theory-foundations/pitch-rhythm/intervals"}}